text:
Just did my first experiments with
@figma
Motion, and even though they're pretty simple, I'm already really impressed.  Figma continues to do an amazing job of being a UI/UX tool because every feature is designed with the same easy, intuitive UX philosophy.  I only have one complaint so far: the timeline can be a bit buggy at times.  Anyone who's ever built a timeline component knows how tricky it is.

